      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "When Elena calls Chef Barinov on the phone to thank him warmly for the anonymous bouquet of flowers, Barinov realizes his gesture worked after all. Meanwhile at the apartment, Nastya eagerly questions a nervous Kostya about whether he spoke with her father and if her parents are coming tomorrow.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
