    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go back through the conversation line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Алло, Виктор Петрович, добрый день.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, Viktor Petrovich, good afternoon.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Алло. Алло.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello. Yes, hello.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Хотел сказать вам огромное спасибо за цветы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I wanted to say a huge thank-you for the flowers.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Всегда пожалуйста за цветы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are always welcome for the flowers.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Откуда вы узнали?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How did you find out they were from me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Ну как?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, how could I not?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Как вы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just like you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Еще раз огромное вам спасибо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you so very much once again.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Ну что, поговорил с папой?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, did you talk to my dad?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "И что ты ему сказал?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And what did you say to him?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
